#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:146
msgid "VDI Gateways"
msgstr "Gateways VDI"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:148
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Worker is a light weight distributed worker daemon as well"
" as a scalable VDI Gateway. Currently, the features center around VDI "
"Gateway but will expand to support full plugin workloads as well as agent"
" relay capabilities."
msgstr ""
"The |morpheus| Worker is a light weight distributed worker daemon así como "
"a scalable VDI Gateway. Currently, the features center around VDI Gateway "
"but will expand to support full plugin workloads así como agent relay "
"capabilities."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:151
msgid "Adding VDI Gateways to |morpheus|"
msgstr "Agregar Gateways VDI a |morpheus|"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:153
msgid ""
"VDI Gateways can be linked to a |morpheus| appliance and then used in VDI"
" Pool configurations. VDI sessions will be redirected to configured "
"gateways instead of the |morpheus| appliance when a VDI Gateway is "
"specified for a VDI Pool."
msgstr ""
"VDI Gateways puede ser linked to a |morpheus| appliance and then used in "
"VDI Pool configurations. VDI sessions será redirected to configured "
"gateways instead of the |morpheus| appliance when a VDI Gateway is "
"specified for a VDI Pool."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:155
msgid ""
"A VDI Gateway is a separate VM or container Instance used to route users "
"to VDI Instances. The |morpheus| VDI Gateway section is for configuring a"
" connection to a VDI Gateway, not creating the gateway Instance itself."
msgstr ""
"A VDI Gateway is a separate VM or container Instancia used to route "
"usuarios to VDI Instancias. The |morpheus| VDI Gateway sección is for "
"configuring a connection to a VDI Gateway, not creating the gateway "
"Instancia itself."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:157
msgid ""
"**NAME** Specify a name for the VDI Gateway in |morpheus|. Note that the "
"VDI Gateway Name is not used when connecting to the gateway"
msgstr ""
"**NAME** Specify a nombre for the VDI Gateway in |morpheus|. Note that the "
"VDI Gateway Name is not used when connecting to the gateway"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:158
msgid ""
"**DESCRIPTION** Specify a description for the VDI Gateway in |morpheus|. "
"(optional)"
msgstr ""
"**DESCRIPTION** Specify a description for the VDI Gateway in |morpheus|. "
"(opcional)"

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:159
msgid ""
"**GATEWAY URL** The url of the VDI Gateway. This url is used to connect "
"to the gateway, and should match the the worker url of the VDI Gateway."
msgstr ""
"**GATEWAY URL** The url of the VDI Gateway. This url se utiliza to connect "
"to the gateway, and should match the the worker url of the VDI Gateway."

#: ../../tools/vdi_pools.rst:161
msgid ""
"Upon creation, the VDI Gateway record will produce an ``API KEY``. This "
"``API KEY`` needs to be specified in the ``morpheus-worker.rb`` file on "
"the API Gateway itself under ``worker['apikey'] = '$API_KEY'``. Once the "
"gateway object is created you will need to configure it as the default "
"gateway in |morpheus| global settings (|AdmSetApp|). Scroll down to the "
"\"Default Console Gateway\" setting and select the gateway object you've "
"just created. Continue on to the next section to actually install the "
"gateway and configure it with your API key."
msgstr ""
"Upon creation, the VDI Gateway record will produce an ``API KEY``. This "
"``API KEY`` needs to be specified in the ``morpheus-worker.rb`` file on "
"the API Gateway itself under ``worker['apikey'] = '$API_KEY'``. Once the "
"gateway object is created you will need to configure it as the default "
"gateway in |morpheus| global settings (|AdmSetApp|). Scroll down to the "
"\"Default Console Gateway\" setting and seleccione el gateway object "
"you've just created. Continue on to the next section to actually install "
"the gateway and configure it with your API key."

